type: software
title: "storyboard-to-seedance-suite"
abstract: "A procedural workflow for AI video production: storyboard generation, single-image linear depth-map conversion, direct 3x3 depth-only storyboard generation from visual and depth references, character or product references, and motion prompts for Seedance 2.0. Cross-platform compatible with Hermes Agent, Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex CLI, and Pi."
